==Statistics==
All statistics relate to the initial 33-man squads named before the start of the tournament on 8 September 2023, and do not include players who joined a squad during the tournament.
* Four squads have all of their players attached to clubs based within their home country: [[France national rugby union team|France]], [[Ireland national rugby union team|Ireland]], [[Japan national rugby union team|Japan]] and [[New Zealand national rugby union team|New Zealand]].
* One squad has none of their players attached to clubs based within their home country: [[Tonga national rugby union team|Tonga]].

